"""The curated, plain-English text of Fjordvik's data dictionary.

Every table, column, metric, rule and tool the dictionary describes is written here once;
`dictionary.py` reads it together with the tables, the Power BI model and the service AI
results, and builds the workbook. A test fails when a table column, a Power BI measure or
a catalogue metric has no entry here.

All data is synthetic: Fjordvik Manufacturing Oy is fictional, and the emission factors
are illustrative, not cited.
"""

